  "<span class=\"orch-chip relay\" title=\"Pipeline: 並列の枝が、それぞれ別の worktree で動いています。すべて終わったら合流でマージします\">{v}並列「{v2}」の枝 {n} 本を待機中</span>": { en: "<span class=\"orch-chip relay\" title=\"Pipeline: parallel branches each run in their own worktree. When all of them finish, they are merged at the join\">{v}Waiting for {n} branches of parallel “{v2}”</span>", es: "<span class=\"orch-chip relay\" title=\"Pipeline: cada rama paralela se ejecuta en su propio worktree. Cuando terminan todas, se fusionan en la unión\">{v}En espera de {n} ramas del paralelo «{v2}»</span>", fr: "<span class=\"orch-chip relay\" title=\"Pipeline : chaque branche parallèle tourne dans son propre worktree. Quand elles ont toutes fini, elles fusionnent à la jonction\">{v}En attente de {n} branches du parallèle « {v2} »</span>", zh: "<span class=\"orch-chip relay\" title=\"Pipeline：并行分支各自在单独的 worktree 中运行。全部结束后在汇合处合并\">{v}正在等待并行「{v2}」的 {n} 个分支</span>" },
